<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Http on AXLROSE</title><link>https://echotrue.github.io/tags/http/</link><description>Recent content in Http on AXLROSE</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>axlrose.huang@gmail.com (Axlrose)</managingEditor><webMaster>axlrose.huang@gmail.com (Axlrose)</webMaster><copyright>2023 Axlrose rights reserved</copyright><lastBuildDate>Fri, 09 Aug 2024 15:49:15 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://echotrue.github.io/tags/http/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>http.Response.Body未被完全读取的问题</title><link>https://echotrue.github.io/blog/golang/http-response-body/</link><pubDate>Fri, 09 Aug 2024 15:49:15 +0800</pubDate><author>axlrose.huang@gmail.com (Axlrose)</author><guid>https://echotrue.github.io/blog/golang/http-response-body/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;经常在一些开源的包中(例如：&lt;code&gt;dghubble/sling&lt;/code&gt;)处理http响应体的时候出现这么一段代码：&lt;code&gt;defer io.Copy(io.Discard, resp.Body)&lt;/code&gt;。这段代码的作用主要是丢弃掉响应体中的内容。为什么要这么做呢？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>